title: "EpistemicTypes.jl"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-23"
url: "https://github.com/hyperpolymath/EpistemicTypes.jl"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hyperpolymath/EpistemicTypes.jl"
license: MPL-2.0
abstract: >-
  Per-row claims with receipts for taxonomic tables. Each classifier call is
  bound to its standpoint (tool, database, parameters), its warrant (the
  classifier's scores and the sample gates) and its projection (taxon, rank,
  feature, sample), and given an epistemic status, a residual summary and a
  merge verdict for pooling two runs.
keywords:
